      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794436693366,
      "created": 1794436560136,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The representation of the\ndifferent queues of RabbitMQ is\njust to simplify de diagramming of\nthe communication between\nmicroservices, but they all use a\nRabbitMQ cluster, with different\nexchanges and queues.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iEd79DqD3L_p_MAWUx_vx",
      "originalText": "The representation of the different queues of RabbitMQ is just to simplify de diagramming of the communication between microservices, but they all use a RabbitMQ cluster, with different exchanges and queues.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
